OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice merger can be stopped,
OL,4,Aclaims PCC
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey's Police Crime Commissioner Lisa
OL,7,FTownsend has said she believes a
OL,8,Fmassive overhaul of policing can be
OL,9,Fhalted.
OL,11,FIn January, the government confirmed it
OL,12,Fintended to merge 43 forces across
OL,13,FEngland and Wales into larger, regional
OL,14,Fforces.
OL,16,FBut Townsend said the situation had
OL,17,F"potentially changed" since Andy
OL,18,FBurnham took power.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
